title: '? Drop unneeded unpleasant vignettes from stories.'
pid: 9519637f-9e0d-492a-b937-d6bac2b0a289
body: |2-
  Include them if they have a purpose;
  if they don't, who cares -- the fact that it happened,
  even if I've always told the story that way,
  is insufficient reason to include in a retelling.
